   "B": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the general business law, in relation to requiring retailers\nof micromobility devices, bicycles with electric assist and limited use\nmotorcycles powered by lithium-ion batteries, and lithium-ion batteries\nintended for use in such devices or bicycles to provide customers with an\noperating manual",
